                the wallpaper a little way below the header's bottom edge, so the

                header-to-content boundary isn't a hard line. Lives outside

                HeaderContainer (which clips its own 60px bounds) so it can

                actually spill past that edge; RowSpan reaches into the content

                row and Panel.ZIndex keeps it drawn above that content. Wired in

                code-behind alongside the rest of InitHeaderWallpaperGlass &#x2014;

